#. module: medical_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:product.template,consent_text:medical_ophthalmology.product_ivi_product_template
msgid ""
"I agree to an injection into the eye. Possible risks were explained: redness"
" and discomfort, floaters, raised eye pressure, and rarely infection inside "
"the eye (endophthalmitis) or retinal detachment, which need urgent care. I "
"will come back at once for pain or reduced vision."
msgstr ""

#. module: medical_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:product.template,consent_text:medical_ophthalmology.product_phaco_product_template
msgid ""
"I agree to cataract surgery with lens implant on the eye shown on this form."
" The surgeon explained the expected result, the need for glasses for some "
"tasks after surgery, and the possible risks: inflammation, raised eye "
"pressure, posterior capsule opacification, infection, retinal detachment "
"and, rarely, loss of vision."
msgstr ""

#. module: medical_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:product.template,consent_text:medical_ophthalmology.product_pterygium_product_template
msgid ""
"I agree to pterygium excision on the eye shown on this form. The surgeon "
"explained the expected result, the need for glasses for some tasks after "
"surgery, and the possible risks: inflammation, raised eye pressure, "
"posterior capsule opacification, infection, retinal detachment and, rarely, "
"loss of vision."
msgstr ""

#. module: medical_ophthalmology
#: model_terms:product.template,consent_text:medical_ophthalmology.product_prp_product_template
#: model_terms:product.template,consent_text:medical_ophthalmology.product_slt_product_template
#: model_terms:product.template,consent_text:medical_ophthalmology.product_yag_product_template
msgid ""
"I agree to the laser treatment of the eye shown on this form. The doctor "
"explained the purpose and the possible effects: temporary blurred vision, "
"glare, a short rise in eye pressure and, rarely, inflammation or worsened "
"vision."
msgstr ""

